## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

This XHTML visual test creates one empty div. Its ::before pseudo-element increments counter test and renders counter(test, armenian), so the expected first item is Armenian capital AYB (U+0531). The div supplies a 2px black border and 30px height. rel=match points to a reference that puts the literal U+0531 character inside an equally styled div. The comparison isolates counter-generated content from a literal expected glyph. No script or event handlers exist.


